{"provider":"github","id":"7230","externalId":"5801409713","revision":"2026-10-11T15:50:18Z","type":"issue","title":"prstatus: result file written non-atomically with 0o644","body":"**Problem:** `prstatus.Publish` writes the result file with `os.WriteFile(resultFile, data, 0o644)` after the status is already published. A crash can leave a torn file that later stages consume; mode is world-readable whereas other state uses atomic writes with 0o600.\n\n**Location:** `internal/prstatus/prstatus.go:69` (Publish)\n\n**Scope:** use `journal.WriteFileAtomic` (or the repo's equivalent non-journal atomic helper if importing journal is undesirable) with 0o600; keep returning `ResultWriteError`.\n\n**Acceptance:** result file written atomically with 0o600; test covers content and mode; error still wrapped as `ResultWriteError`.\n\nConfidence: moderate (lenses: reliability, security; low sensitivity). Source: quality-sprint collate.\nNomination key: qs/reliability/internal/prstatus/prstatus.go#PublishAndWriteResult\n","labels":["area:runner","goobers:approved","goobers:ready","goobers:claimed","goobers:nominated","type:bug","goobers:cloud"],"state":"open","status":"open","links":[{"rel":"self","url":"https://github.com/Agent-Clubhouse/Goobers/issues/7230"}],"url":"https://github.com/Agent-Clubhouse/Goobers/issues/7230","createdAt":"2026-10-11T13:17:37Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-11T15:50:18Z","readyAt":"2026-10-11T13:40:54Z","fields":{"comments":4,"created_at":"2026-10-11T13:17:37Z","id":5801409713,"issue_dependencies_summary.total_blocked_by":0,"locked":false,"number":7230,"state":"open","title":"prstatus: result file written non-atomically with 0o644","updated_at":"2026-10-11T15:50:18Z","user.login":"goobersbot[bot]"},"raw":{"id":5801409713,"number":7230,"title":"prstatus: result file written non-atomically with 0o644","body":"**Problem:** `prstatus.Publish` writes the result file with `os.WriteFile(resultFile, data, 0o644)` after the status is already published. A crash can leave a torn file that later stages consume; mode is world-readable whereas other state uses atomic writes with 0o600.\n\n**Location:** `internal/prstatus/prstatus.go:69` (Publish)\n\n**Scope:** use `journal.WriteFileAtomic` (or the repo's equivalent non-journal atomic helper if importing journal is undesirable) with 0o600; keep returning `ResultWriteError`.\n\n**Acceptance:** result file written atomically with 0o600; test covers content and mode; error still wrapped as `ResultWriteError`.\n\nConfidence: moderate (lenses: reliability, security; low sensitivity). Source: quality-sprint collate.\nNomination key: qs/reliability/internal/prstatus/prstatus.go#PublishAndWriteResult\n","state":"open","state_reason":"","locked":false,"comments":4,"html_url":"https://github.com/Agent-Clubhouse/Goobers/issues/7230","user":{"login":"goobersbot[bot]","type":"Bot"},"labels":[{"name":"area:runner","color":"1d76db","description":"Local runner: lifecycle, scheduler, stages, CLI"},{"name":"goobers:approved","color":"0E8A16","description":"Maintainer-approved — eligible for curation/implementation (SEC-047)"},{"name":"goobers:ready","color":"1D76DB","description":"Curated and scoped — eligible for implementation"},{"name":"goobers:claimed","color":"FBCA04","description":"Currently claimed by an in-flight run"},{"name":"goobers:nominated","color":"5319E7","description":"Filed by the nominator — awaiting maintainer approval"},{"name":"type:bug","color":"D73A4A","description":"Defect in existing behavior"},{"name":"goobers:cloud","color":"1d76db","description":"Claim-partition: issue belongs to the cloud (Goobernetes) instance"}],"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"created_at":"2026-10-11T13:17:37Z","updated_at":"2026-10-11T15:50:18Z","issue_dependencies_summary":{"total_blocked_by":0},"pull_request":null},"integrity":"maintainer"}